WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.240
You might just as well say that I see what I eat is the same thing as I eat what I see.

2
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.060
You might just as well say, added the March Hare, that I like what I get is the same thing

3
00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.100
as I get what I like.

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.100
You might just as well say, added the Dormouse, who seemed to be talking in his sleep, that

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.300
I breathe when I sleep is the same thing as I sleep when I breathe.
